="about__intro reveal-in-up" style="--reveal-delay: 250ms;">MauDev is a family-owned developer and general contractor built for long-term execution. The team combines acquisition, densification, financing, construction, leasing, and administration under one roof to reduce friction and protect investor returns.</p> <div class="about__capital reveal-in-up" style="--reveal-delay: 500ms;"> <p>2025 construction volume</p> <strong class="about__capital-value" data-counter-target="30" data-counter-suffix="m$"> 0m$ </strong> </div> </section> <section class="about__formula" data-node-id="138:152"> <h2 class="about__formula-heading">One integrated platform</h2> <article class="formula-card formula-card--tone-1"> <div class="width formula-card__inner"> <div class="formula-card__media" aria-hidden="true"></div> <div class="formula-card__copy reveal-on-scroll" style="--reveal-delay:140ms;"> <p class="formula-card__label">Acquire &amp; densify</p> <p>MauDev targets sites at a favorable land basis and creates value through zoning work, densification, and disciplined market selection.</p> </div> </div> </article><article class="formula-card formula-card--flip formula-card--tone-2"> <div class="width formula-card__inner"> <div class="formula-card__media" aria-hidden="true"></div> <div class="formula-card__copy reveal-on-scroll" style="--reveal-delay:260ms;"> <p class="formula-card__label">Finance &amp; build</p> <p>The team manages financing, tendering, contracts, and site execution, while Trexco and Distributions M. Dion improve control over risk, pricing, and supply.</p> </div> </div> </article><article class="formula-card formula-card--tone-3"> <div class="width formula-card__inner"> <div class="formula-card__media" aria-hidden="true"></div> <div class="formula-card__copy reveal-on-scroll" style="--reveal-delay:380ms;"> <p class="formula-card__label">Lease &amp; manage</p> <p>MauDev carries the asset through tenant selection, lease-up, administration, quarterly statements, and year-end reporting.</p> </div> </div> </article> </section> <section class="width about__values" data-node-id="141:132"> <h2>Why investors partner with MauDev</h2> <div class="faq-list"> <details class="faq-item"> <summary class="faq-summary"> <span>1. Long-term vision</span> </summary> <div class="faq-answer"> <p>As a family business, MauDev develops assets with a long view of quality, durability, and investor alignment.</p> </div> </details><details class="faq-item"> <summary class="faq-summary"> <span>2. Transparency</span> </summary> <div class="faq-answer"> <p>The company emphasizes clear communication, disciplined reporting, and visible accountability throughout the project lifecycle.</p> </div> </details><details class="faq-item"> <summary class="faq-summary"> <span>3. Vertical integration</span> </summary> <div class="faq-answer"> <p>Trexco and Distributions M. Dion improve control over excavation risk, supply, pricing, and construction execution.</p> </div> </details><details class="faq-item"> <summary class="faq-summary"> <span>4. Local market discipline</span> </summary> <div class="faq-answer"> <p>MauDev focuses on local markets with strong rental demand, stable pricing, and identifiable value-add opportunities.</p> </div> </details> </div> </section> <section class="about__team" data-node-id="141:131"> <div class="width about__team-grid"> <div class="about__team-image" aria-hidden="true"></div> <div> <h2>Leadership</h2> <p>MauDev is led by Alexandre Paquin, President - Finance, Jean-Christophe Paquin, President - Development, and Samuel Brisson, President - Construction. The broader team also includes Pierre-Hugues in development, Stéphanie Grenon in finance, and Marc-André Dion in business development.</p> </div> </div> </section> </section> <script>
  (() => {
    const revealCards = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.about__formula .reveal-on-scroll'));
    const revealElement = (el) => el.classList.add('is-visible');

    if (revealCards.length) {
      if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {
        revealCards.forEach(revealElement);
      } else {
        const revealObserver = new IntersectionObserver(
          (entries, obs) => {
            entries.forEach((entry) => {
              if (!entry.isIntersecting) return;
              revealElement(entry.target);
              obs.unobserve(entry.target);
            });
          },
          {
            threshold: 0.2,
            rootMargin: '0px 0px -10% 0px'
          }
        );

        revealCards.forEach((card) => revealObserver.observe(card));
      }
    }

    const counter = document.querySelector('.about__capital-value[data-counter-target]');
    if (!counter) return;

    const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    const revealContainer = counter.closest('.about__capital');
    const target = Number(counter.dataset.counterTarget ?? Number.NaN);
    const suffix = counter.dataset.counterSuffix ?? '';
    const duration = 750;
    const formatValue = (value) => `${Math.round(value)}${suffix}`;

    if (Number.isNaN(target)) return;

    counter.textContent = formatValue(0);

    const toMilliseconds = (timeValue) => {
      const raw = (timeValue ?? '').trim();
      if (!raw) return 0;
      if (raw.endsWith('ms')) return Number.parseFloat(raw);
      if (raw.endsWith('s')) return Number.parseFloat(raw) * 1000;
      return Number.parseFloat(raw) || 0;
    };

    const setFinalValue = () => {
      counter.textContent = formatValue(target);
      counter.dataset.counterDone = 'true';
    };

    const animateCounter = () => {
      if (counter.dataset.counterDone === 'true') return;

      const start = performance.now();

      const tick = (now) => {
        const progress = Math.min((now - start) / duration, 1);
        const eased = 1 - Math.pow(1 - progress, 3);
        counter.textContent = formatValue(target * eased);

        if (progress < 1) {
          requestAnimationFrame(tick);
          return;
        }

        counter.dataset.counterDone = 'true';
      };

      requestAnimationFrame(tick);
    };

    const startWithReveal = () => {
      if (!revealContainer) {
        animateCounter();
        return;
      }

      let hasStarted = false;
      const startOnce = () => {
        if (hasStarted) return;
        hasStarted = true;
        animateCounter();
      };

      const computed = window.getComputedStyle(revealContainer);
      const delayValue = (computed.animationDelay || '0ms').split(',')[0];
      const fallbackDelay = toMilliseconds(delayValue) + 20;

      revealContainer.addEventListener(
        'animationstart',
        (event) => {
          if (event.target !== revealContainer) return;
          startOnce();
        },
        { once: true }
      );

      window.setTimeout(startOnce, fallbackDelay);
    };

    if (prefersReducedMotion) {
      setFinalValue();
      return;
    }

    if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {
      startWithReveal();
      return;
    }

    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
      (entries) => {
        entries.forEach((entry) => {
          if (!entry.isIntersecting) return;
          startWithReveal();
          observer.unobserve(counter);
        });
      },
      { threshold: 0.5 }
    );

    observer.observe(counter);
  })();
</script> </main> <footer class="global-footer"> <div class="global-footer__inner"> <section class="global-footer__col"> <h3>Pages</h3> <ul> <li><a href="../en">Overview</a></li><li><a href="about">About us</a></li><li><a href="projects">Projects</a></li> </ul> </section> <section class="global-footer__col"> <h3>Social</h3> <ul> <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></li><li><a href="https://www.instagram.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Instagram</a></li><li><a href="https://www.facebook.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Facebook</a></li> </ul> </section> <section class="global-footer__col"> <h3>Contact</h3> <ul> <li><strong>Address:</strong> 47 rue Nicholson, Salaberry de Valleyfield</li> <!-- <li><strong>{text.phone}:</strong> +1 555 010 020</li> --> <li><strong>Email:</strong> info@mau-dev.ca</li> </ul> </section> </div> <div class="global-footer__copyright"> <div class="global-footer__inner">© 2026 MauDev - All rights reserved.</div> </div> </footer> </body></html>